igher than FFT available top frequency. This caused many visual effects to stop tracking audio correctly in Unity6.", "created_date": 1772641105, "id": "25706420672393297", "version": "2.0.4", "version_code": 2004, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26477995768569113"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3884256074957968"}]}, "change_log": "# 2.0.2 (20251206)\n\nFixed device tracking offset for OpenXR relative mode, and adjusted various assets to match.\n\n# 2.0.1 (20251206)\n\nSecurity update for Unity.\n\nBug fixes: Lots of things ...\nMaintenance: Unity 2022.3.62f2\n", "created_date": 1765051207, "id": "24952925571076148", "version": "2.0.2", "version_code": 2002, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26477995768569113"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1765029144, "id": "24950632024638836", "version": "2.0.1", "version_code": 2001, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFi